   "announcedAt": "2024-05-28T15:24:37.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Previously the game required SSE4.1 to run. I've now made some slight modifications so as to only require SSE3. This will improve compatibility with some older CPUs.",
